OL,3,GNEWSAFormer church leader and wife
OL,4,Acharged with rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former church leader and his wife
OL,7,Fhave been charged with several counts
OL,8,Fof rape dating back to 2008.
OL,10,FPolice said Stephen and Janet Timmis,
OL,11,Faged 68 and 61, of Psalter Lane,
OL,12,FSheffield, had each been charged with
OL,13,Feight counts of rape against the same
OL,14,Fwoman following a report of non-recent
OL,15,Fsexual abuse.
OL,17,FThe charges relate to offences alleged
OL,18,Fto have taken place between May and
OL,19,FSeptember 2008 while Timmis was a
OL,20,Fleader at The Crowded House church in
OL,21,Fthe city.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
